  "sections": [
    {
      "name": "Verse 1",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Cm/G]A hymn [Eb/Bb]of glory [Bb]let [Eb/Bb]us sing;",
        "[Eb/Bb]New hymns [Cm]thro'-out [Bb]the world [Eb]shall [Cm/Eb]ring",
        "[Eb]Alleluia! [Bb]Alleluia!",
        "[Cm]Christ, [Bb7]by [Eb/Bb]a [Ab]road [Bb]before [Bb7/Ab]untrod,",
        "[Eb]Ascends [Fm/C]unto [Bb/D]the [Cm]throne [Bb]of [Fm/C]God.",
        "[Fm/C]Alleluia! [Bb]Alleluia!",
        "[Cm/G]Alleluia, [Gm]alleluia, [Fm/C]alleluia!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 2",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Cm/G]O Lord, [Fm/Ab]our [Eb]homeward [Bb]pathway [Eb/Bb]bend,",
        "[Eb/Bb]That our [Cm]unwearied [Bb]hearts [Eb]ascend.",
        "[Eb]Alleluia! [Bb]Alleluia!",
        "[Cm]Where, [Bb7]seated [Ab]on [Bb]Your [Eb/Bb]Father's throne,",
        "[Eb]You [Fm/C]reign as [Bb/F]King of [Cm]kings [Bb]alone.",
        "[Fm/C]Alleluia! [Bb]Alleluia!",
        "[Cm/G]Alleluia, [Gm]alleluia, [Fm/C]alleluia!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 3",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Cm/G]Give us [Eb/Bb]Your joy [Fm]on [Bb]earth, [Eb/Bb]O Lord,",
        "[Eb/Bb]In heav'n [Cm]to [Fm]be [Bb]our [Eb]great reward.",
        "[Eb]Alleluia! [Bb]Alleluia!",
        "[Cm]When [Bb7]throned [Eb/Bb]with [Ab]You [Bb]forever, [Eb/Bb]we",
        "[Eb]Shall [Fm/C]praise Your [Bb/F]name eternally.",
        "[Fm/C]Alleluia! [Bb]Alleluia!",
        "[Cm/G]Alleluia, [Gm]alleluia, [Fm/C]alleluia!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 4",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Cm/G]O risen [Eb]Christ, [Fm]ascended [Eb/Bb]Lord,",
        "[Eb/Bb]All praise [Cm]to [Fm]you [Bb]let [Eb]earth accord:",
        "[Eb]Alleluia! [Bb]Alleluia!",
        "[Cm]You [Bb7]are, [Eb/Bb]while [Bb/F]endless [Eb/Bb]ages run,",
        "[Eb]With [Fm/C]Father [Bb/F]and with [Cm]Spirit [Fm/C]one.",
        "[Fm/C]Alleluia! [Bb]Alleluia!",
        "[Cm/G]Alleluia, [Gm]alleluia, [Fm/C]alleluia!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
